## Overview

This library provides Python interfaces for MoveIt2 in ROS2 Jazzy, enabling:

- **Motion Planning & Execution**: Plan and execute trajectories to Cartesian poses or joint configurations
- **Kinematics**: Forward and inverse kinematics computation
- **Collision Management**: Add, remove, attach, and manage collision objects in the planning scene
- **Gripper Control**: Multiple interfaces for controlling robot grippers
- **Real-Time Servo**: Low-latency Cartesian velocity control

### Architecture

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                        MoveIt2 (Core)                          │
│  - Motion planning (Cartesian & Joint space)                   │
│  - Trajectory execution                                        │
│  - FK/IK computation                                           │
│  - Collision object management                                 │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
           │                              │
           ▼                              ▼
┌─────────────────────┐      ┌─────────────────────────────────┐
│   MoveIt2Gripper    │      │        MoveIt2Servo             │
│   (extends MoveIt2) │      │   (Real-time Twist control)     │
└─────────────────────┘      └─────────────────────────────────┘
           │
           │      ┌─────────────────────┐
           │      │    GripperCommand   │
           │      │  (GripperCmd action)│
           │      └─────────────────────┘
           │                 │
           ▼                 ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐
│           GripperInterface              │
│  (Auto-selects MoveIt2Gripper or        │
│   GripperCommand based on availability) │
└─────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

